
{ "head": { "link": [], "vars": ["f", "order", "cit", "c", "type", "text"] },
  "results": { "distinct": false, "ordered": true, "bindings": [
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/1963/99/2021-07-01/dokument/norma/cast_3/hlava_1/par_114b/odst_1" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BDBA32B" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 114b odst. 1" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/750151" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(1)</var> Vy\u017Eaduje-li to povaha v\u011Bci nebo okolnosti p\u0159\u00EDpadu, jako\u017E i tehdy, bylo-li o v\u011Bci rozhodnuto platebn\u00EDm rozkazem, elektronick\u00FDm platebn\u00EDm rozkazem nebo evropsk\u00FDm platebn\u00EDm rozkazem, m\u016F\u017Ee p\u0159edseda sen\u00E1tu m\u00EDsto v\u00FDzvy podle <a data-odkaz-id=\"22373191\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">\u00A7 114a odst. 2 p\u00EDsm. a)</a> nebo nebylo-li takov\u00E9 v\u00FDzv\u011B \u0159\u00E1dn\u011B a v\u010Das vyhov\u011Bno, \u017Ealovan\u00E9mu usnesen\u00EDm ulo\u017Eit, aby se ve v\u011Bci p\u00EDsemn\u011B vyj\u00E1d\u0159il a aby v p\u0159\u00EDpad\u011B, \u017Ee n\u00E1rok uplatn\u011Bn\u00FD v \u017Ealob\u011B zcela neuzn\u00E1, ve vyj\u00E1d\u0159en\u00ED vyl\u00ED\u010Dil rozhoduj\u00EDc\u00ED skute\u010Dnosti, na nich\u017E stav\u00ED svoji obranu, a k vyj\u00E1d\u0159en\u00ED p\u0159ipojil listinn\u00E9 d\u016Fkazy, jich\u017E se dovol\u00E1v\u00E1, pop\u0159\u00EDpad\u011B ozna\u010Dil d\u016Fkazy k prok\u00E1z\u00E1n\u00ED sv\u00FDch tvrzen\u00ED; to neplat\u00ED ve v\u011Bcech, v nich\u017E nelze uzav\u0159\u00EDt a schv\u00E1lit sm\u00EDr (<a data-odkaz-id=\"22373209\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">\u00A7 99 odst. 1</a> a <a data-odkaz-id=\"22373227\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">2</a>), nebo je-li \u017Ealovan\u00FDm ke dni zah\u00E1jen\u00ED \u0159\u00EDzen\u00ED nebo ke dni vstupu do \u0159\u00EDzen\u00ED nezletil\u00FD, kter\u00FD nenabyl pln\u00E9 sv\u00E9pr\u00E1vnosti." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/1963/99/2021-07-01/dokument/norma/cast_3/hlava_1/par_114b/odst_5" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BDBA33180" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 114b odst. 5" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/738605" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(5)</var> Jestli\u017Ee se \u017Ealovan\u00FD bez v\u00E1\u017En\u00E9ho d\u016Fvodu na v\u00FDzvu soudu podle <a data-odkaz-id=\"22306665\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">odstavce 1</a> v\u010Das nevyj\u00E1d\u0159\u00ED a ani ve stanoven\u00E9 lh\u016Ft\u011B soudu nesd\u011Bl\u00ED, jak\u00FD v\u00E1\u017En\u00FD d\u016Fvod mu v tom br\u00E1n\u00ED, m\u00E1 se za to, \u017Ee n\u00E1rok, kter\u00FD je proti n\u011Bmu \u017Ealobou uplat\u0148ov\u00E1n, uzn\u00E1v\u00E1; o tomto n\u00E1sledku (<a data-odkaz-id=\"22306761\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">\u00A7 153a odst. 3</a>) mus\u00ED b\u00FDt pou\u010Den. To neplat\u00ED, jsou-li spln\u011Bny p\u0159edpoklady pro zastaven\u00ED \u0159\u00EDzen\u00ED nebo odm\u00EDtnut\u00ED \u017Ealoby." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/1963/99/2021-07-01/dokument/norma/cast_3/hlava_1/par_114b/odst_2" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BDBA32D" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 114b odst. 2" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/748065" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(2)</var> K pod\u00E1n\u00ED vyj\u00E1d\u0159en\u00ED podle <a data-odkaz-id=\"22110833\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">odstavce 1</a> p\u0159edseda sen\u00E1tu ur\u010D\u00ED lh\u016Ftu, kter\u00E1 nesm\u00ED b\u00FDt krat\u0161\u00ED ne\u017E 30 dn\u016F od doru\u010Den\u00ED usnesen\u00ED. Bylo-li o v\u011Bci rozhodnuto platebn\u00EDm rozkazem, elektronick\u00FDm platebn\u00EDm rozkazem nebo evropsk\u00FDm platebn\u00EDm rozkazem, ur\u010D\u00ED tuto lh\u016Ftu a\u017E ode dne uplynut\u00ED lh\u016Fty k pod\u00E1n\u00ED odporu proti platebn\u00EDmu rozkazu, elektronick\u00E9mu platebn\u00EDmu rozkazu nebo evropsk\u00E9mu platebn\u00EDmu rozkazu." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/1963/99/2021-07-01/dokument/norma/cast_3/hlava_1/par_114b/odst_3" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BDBA32F" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 114b odst. 3" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/738597" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(3)</var> Usnesen\u00ED podle <a data-odkaz-id=\"22306071\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">odstavce 1</a> nelze vydat nebo doru\u010Dit po p\u0159\u00EDpravn\u00E9m jedn\u00E1n\u00ED podle <a data-odkaz-id=\"22306167\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">\u00A7 114c</a> nebo po prvn\u00EDm jedn\u00E1n\u00ED ve v\u011Bci." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/1963/99/2021-07-01/dokument/norma/cast_3/hlava_1/par_114b/odst_4" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BDBA33080" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 114b odst. 4" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/748067" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(4)</var> Usnesen\u00ED podle <a data-odkaz-id=\"22110895\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">odstavce 1</a> mus\u00ED b\u00FDt \u017Ealovan\u00E9mu doru\u010Deno do vlastn\u00EDch rukou. N\u00E1hradn\u00ED doru\u010Den\u00ED je vylou\u010Deno; to neplat\u00ED, doru\u010Duje-li se prost\u0159ednictv\u00EDm ve\u0159ejn\u00E9 datov\u00E9 s\u00EDt\u011B do datov\u00E9 schr\u00E1nky. Usnesen\u00ED nesm\u00ED b\u00FDt \u017Ealovan\u00E9mu doru\u010Deno d\u0159\u00EDve ne\u017E \u017Ealoba." }} ] } }